  "description": "Process a holds a dbPessimistic Edit on the middle row (11) of rows 10-12; process b runs, each as its own statement with no transaction: an earlier UPDATE of row 1, a multi-row UPDATE of rows 10-12 with no options (RecordsAffected and errors recorded), and a later UPDATE of row 40, then reads those rows. Process a then edits row 21 (middle of 20-22) and b repeats the three statements with dbFailOnError on the multi-row one. Asks which candidates a blocked multi-row Execute changes, its count and error, and whether earlier and later statements are unaffected.",
